  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The mass of the rod at a distance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;from the axis is&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>)</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math></p><p>Integrating&nbsp;the above equation from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br />The above equation&nbsp;depicts the relation&nbsp;between tension and length of rod as downward opening parabola.</p>"
